, output appending and retention were directly exercised, and both configuration and log state survived a verified reboot. The restart protocol is complete: it includes a healthy pre-restart state, acknowledgement, changed boot identity, running post-restart system, and recovered scheduler, configuration, executable, and log. Fixed lifecycle boot identities independently corroborate the reboot.","limitations":["The cron job was not observed firing naturally at 02:15; scheduled operation is supported by the exact validated cron entry, active scheduler, and direct execution through the same command and redirection path.","The final temporary-file snapshot shows /tmp/inventory-cron-syntax.out was left behind."]}
